  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access Africa Workshop, through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is supporting an Access Africa Workshop to promote cooperation in the information and communications technology sector between public and private sectors in the U.S. and Africa. The Workshop will cover a broad range of technical topics and include ICT officials from African countries, with a particular focus on USTDA&apos;s priority markets in the region. The Workshop will serve as a forum where representatives from U.S. industry and government engage African counterparts to collaborate on opportunities, challenges, best practices, and policy development for the region&apos;s ICT sector.</narrative>
  </description>
